   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Formation",
     "texto": [
      "With many verbs, take the **ils** form of the present, remove **-ent** and add **-e, -es, -e, -ions, -iez, -ent**: **ils parlent** → **que je parle**.",
      "Some verbs change stem between **je/tu/il/ils** and **nous/vous**: **ils viennent** → **qu'ils viennent**, but **nous venons** → **que nous venions**. Others, like **pouvoir**, have their own stem: **que je puisse, que nous puissions**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "When it is used",
     "texto": [
      "Not every sentence with **que** takes the subjunctive. Certain expressions require it, such as **il faut que** (it is necessary that): **Il faut que tu parles avec le patron** (you need to speak to the boss)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
